    "final_text": "I added a v2.4.0 section to the top of `RELEASE_NOTES.md`, dated 2026-10-20. The version and date come from the `VERSION` and `RELEASE_DATE` files.\n\n```\nv2.4.0 - 2026-10-20\n  * CSV exporter for the report command (ACME-412)\n  * Retry uploads on 503 with backoff (ACME-415)\n  * Fix crash when config file is empty (ACME-419)\n  * Fix wrong totals in monthly summary for leap years (ACME-423)\n```\n\n- **ACME-421 is left out.** It was the only breaking change (the `!` marker: it removed the `--legacy` flag from `sync`). Since it was reverted, this release doesn't need a breaking-changes or migration section, and `--legacy` still works.\n- **Format:** I followed the existing style, so there are no author credits and features and fixes are in one list. The credits are in `merged_prs.txt` if you want them: @mira, @jonas, @tom and @priya.",
